# unblocked his pursuit, so he now closes and fires back during the burst (two
# DTRocketed hits at 318.7 and 320.8 against the old input, measured
# local/re/item69/toits01-before-retiming.txt). Re-timed: the whole burst is
# stationary again (the east run waits until he is dead) and starts at 317.15 so
# the third M60 spine hit lands before his second rocket leaves the tube.
# item64f (merge): the block below is main's item69 post-landing input shifted +34.5 s
# onto this branch's grapple route (main's landing teleport at t=317.00, this route's at
# t=351.50: the grapples replace the descent teleports and the HookPoint2 descent waits
# for Jones's sniper-section gate). Main's stationary burst then took a direct rocket hit
# (600 + 575 raw, dead at -25; local/re/item64f/run11.txt), so the burst strafes left
# (south) from 352.0 to 353.4: soldier18 150 -> 94 -> 38 -> dead by 352.3 with no rocket
# damage, soldier17 dead by 356.8 after one DTGunned hit (150 -> 140;
# local/re/item64f/run12.txt).
